<title>THAILAND: Srithai Superware Q3 profit up 59 pct.</title>
<headline>Srithai Superware Q3 profit up 59 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     3.52	 vs	  2.51</p>
<p>    Net profit	   159.21	 vs	100.29</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     8.70	 vs	  8.48</p>
<p>    Net profit	   364.73	 vs	339.39</p>
<p>NOTES:  Revs/shrs not stated. Company's full name is Srithai Superware Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
